WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:03,500
Boy Zhao Bantou is here

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:07,980
What Fang Yang said is true, sir.

3
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,620
Our dentists on site

4
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:14,860
They can all testify to Mr. Fang about Zhao Hu

5
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:17,100
Do you have any evidence?

6
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:21,440
First let Zhao Bantou conduct an autopsy on the five seats.

7
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:24,680
You take people to follow Zhao Hu to the place where the incident occurred to check it out.

8
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:30,370
At the same time, he brought the person he said was indifferent to him for questioning, sir.

9
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:32,570
Since someone wants to frame me,

10
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:37,240
I would like to ask you to come with me, sir.

11
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:45,130
Zhao Bantou brought a few more people, including Sir Fang Yang.

12
00:00:45,530 --> 00:00:46,610
Since a mistake has been made

13
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:49,050
Just caressing, right?

14
00:00:49,410 --> 00:00:51,410
Mr. Xie is quite elegant today

15
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:53,250
He actually came to the government office to watch the lawsuit

16
00:00:53,370 --> 00:00:54,290
Passing by by chance

17
00:00:54,530 --> 00:00:57,210
I didn't expect to see someone accuse Mr. Fang of murder.

18
00:00:57,410 --> 00:00:59,930
It’s so satisfying. Laugh.

19
00:01:00,580 --> 00:01:02,340
I hope you can keep laughing

20
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:04,500
Then let’s see your Mr. Fang’s extreme words.

21
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:07,300
I also wish Mr. Fang to be exiled as soon as possible
